  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stolen Asset Recovery Initiative (StAR) Multi Donor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE DEVELOPMENT OBJECTIVE OF THE STAR INITIATIVE IS TO IMPROVE GLO performance in return of stolen assets, ultimately leading to a situation where there are no safe havens for the proceeds of corruption. The StAR Initiative seeks to accomplish these objectives by supporting activities in three broad components: (i) Global knowledge generation and advocacy to lower the barriers to asset recovery; (ii) Building national capacity to deter new flows; (iii) Assistance in the Recovery of Stolen Assets.</narrative>
  </description>
